{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.rinze.shoot",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "和风外景的控え室",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.rinze.shoot",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.rinze.shoot",
    "idolId": "rinze",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是吗？好，结束了马上叫你。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉凛世！碰头拖太久了……了……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不……碰头已经结束了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那个，制作人大人？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，抱歉！不由得看入迷了。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是啊……真是很棒的院子呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（看入迷的不只是院子的景色……真想就这样拍下去。）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不、不是……器材好像还要一会儿，你可以再慢慢待着。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "明白了。制作人大人也，在这边……？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，要等一会儿……怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "呵呵……不。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？话说，你在读什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是少女漫画……──向智代子小姐借的。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，刚才说带了东西来，就是这个啊。……是现在播的那部剧吗？凛世喜欢这种？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……在，学习……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "学习？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……智代子小姐说，这上面写着\"恋爱的入门\"。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯……我记得那部剧是卖独特世界观的……）",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……我觉得没错，但别太当真比较好哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……是吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，大概吧。……啊，已经这个时间了。凛世，差不多该移动了。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……制作人大人。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……一直……都在思慕您。已经，不想离开您身边了。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，怎、怎么了突然……？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "想和您，永远，结为连理……",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（啊、啊啊！刚才少女漫画的台词啊！吓我一跳……）咳、咳咳，看来不紧张啊……那就加油吧，凛世！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……是，制作人大人。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那么……马上就到现场了，凛世，准备好了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……在日本家屋的拍摄呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，不愧是凛世，工作内容都记得很清楚！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "如果能帮上忙，那就再好不过了……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别太紧张啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（抱歉，电话。）是的，283制作……辛苦了。嗯，正好在那边……是，我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……发生了什么事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "正好是对方打来的。拍摄前有个简短的碰头——到了现场，凛世先在休息室等着。让你一个人，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不……我带了很不错的东西来。请不用挂心凛世……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
